  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>When you land a melee strike, you can manifest a pulse of energy that warps the target's mind. You can add +2 psychic damage to your attacks. If this melee strike reduces a creature to 0 hit points, you can choose to make the blow non-lethal by using the pulse of psychic energy to ward off the mortal wounds of the strike. You do not take any penalty for using a weapon without the non-lethal trait to do so. </p>"
